Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:05.98,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&}{\t(1782,2950,1,\1c&H5C3C08&\3c&HA09D6D&)}{\t(3534,3575,1,\1c&H6C5C6B&\3c&HB8A5B1&)}{\t(4827,4868,1,\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&)}我一直喜歡著你
